										<h1 class="text-center"> Our Projects</h1>
										<!-- <sup>®</sup> -->
                        				<div class="decs">Trust. Quality. Innovation. Customer first. These are the pillars that turn our projects into landmarks that re-define the way people live and work. From premium residential projects to India’s only ChildCentric® Homes with celebrity learning academies, from cutting edge commercial spaces to service that delights our customers, being leading real estate builders and developers in Pune, Goa, Bengaluru, and California, our goal is always to strive and outdo. Over the last 5 decades, our innovations have set benchmarks in real estate while putting the needs of our customers first. As leading real estate builders and developers in Pune, Goa, Bengaluru, and California, we have introduced neighbourhoods to newer and better ways of life with over 64 projects and 6+ million sq. ft. Our journey has seen us create many industry firsts – from India’s only 7-year warranty in real estate to India’s only ChildCentric® Homes. But our biggest achievement in the last 50 years has been the trust that our customers, partners and associates have invested in us.</div>
