             		<h3 class="text-center"> Gera's 50+ Year Journey </h3>
             		<div class="decs"> Over the last 5 decades, our innovations have set benchmarks in Real Estate while putting the needs of our customers first. With over 64 projects, and with 8.57+ Million sq ft of development as of Dec 2024 across Pune, Goa, Bengaluru, and California, we have introduced neighbourhoods to newer and better ways of life in the city. Our journey has seen us create many industry firsts – from India’s only 7-year warranty in Real Estate to India’s first ChildCentric® Homes. But our biggest achievement in the last 50 years has been the trust that our customers, partners, and associates have invested in us.</div>
