   		<div class="culture-main-box" id="culture">
      		<div class="culture">
         		<div class="container">
            		<div class="row">
               			<div class="col-md-12 wow fadeInDown">
                  			<h3 class="text-center"> A Culture of Innovation </h3>
                  			<div class="decs"> 
                  			At Gera Developments Private Limited, Innovation is a living, breathing value. 
It is in our design blueprints and in our customer service. It is 
in the way we enable our teams to outdo at work, and it is also 
in the way we keep challenging ourselves to create new 
benchmarks in Real Estate that surpass our past milestones. A 
culture of innovation is why we are our biggest competition, 
fuelled by two little words – Let's Outdo.
                  			</div>
                  			<div class="InnovationTabMain">
                     			<ul class="nav nav-tabs InnovationTab mob-dropdown open" role="tablist">
			                        <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link active" data-toggle="tab" href="#Ourmanyfirsts" aria-expanded="true">Our many firsts</a> </li>
			                        <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#Technology" aria-expanded="false">Technology and future focus</a> </li>
			                        <li class="nav-item"> <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#Enablers" aria-expanded="false">Powering People</a> </li>
                     			</ul>
                     			<div class="InnovationTabBorder"> </div>
                     			<div class="divdr"> </div>
                  			</div>
                  			<div class="tab-content wow fadeInUp">
                     			<div id="Ourmanyfirsts" class="tab-pane active">
                        			<div class="culture-slider">
                           				<div>
                              				<div class="culturelistbox">
                             					<div class="culturetxtleft">
                                    				<!-- <div class="cultureleftHeading"> L.I.N.T.</div> -->
                                    				<div class="cultureleftHeading"> India's First <br> 7-Year Warranty </div>
                                    				<p class="culturetxt"> We decided to go the extra mile to ensure that our customers continue to enjoy the many delights of their home without being hassled by the demands of maintenance and upkeep. Our projects come with India’s first 7-year warranty in real estate, a reaffirmation of our commitment to quality, and to putting our customers' happiness first.</p>
                                    				<!-- <div class="learnMore expl"> <a href="#">Explore Now  </a> </div> -->
                                 				</div>
                                 				<div class="culturetxtright"> 
                                    				<img loading="lazy" alt="" data-src="https://www.gera.in/assets/images/webp/01-A.webp" alt="Gera Developments" class="lazyload" width="100%" height="100%"> 
                                 				</div>
                              				</div>
                           				</div>
                           				<div>
                              				<div class="culturelistbox">
                                 				<div class="culturetxtleft">
                                    				<div class="cultureleftHeading"> India’s First <br> ChildCentric<sup>®</sup> Homes</div>
                                    				<p class="culturetxt"> We believe that children deserve an environment that encourages them to pursue their dreams and passions so they can grow to be adults who outdo. Our award-winning ChildCentric® Homes with celebrity learning academies are designed to provide just that. This is where children are trained in everything from dance and drama, sports and leadership to chess and Vedic math, by renowned professionals in their field.</p>
                                    				<!-- <div class="learnMore expl"> <a href="#">Explore Now  </a> </div> -->
                                 				</div>
                                 				<div class="culturetxtright"> 
                                    				<img loading="lazy" alt="" data-src="https://www.gera.in/assets/images/webp/07-A.webp" alt="Gera Developments" class="lazyload" width="100%" height="100%"> 
                                 				</div>
                              				</div>
                           				</div>
                           				<div>
                              				<div class="culturelistbox">
                                 				<div class="culturetxtleft">
                                    				<div class="cultureleftHeading"> Pune’s First <br> Shopping Mall-Gera Plaza </div>
                                    				<p class="culturetxt"> This was an innovation that introduced the city to an international shopping experience way back in 1990.</p>
                                    				<!-- <div class="learnMore expl"> <a href="#">Explore Now  </a> </div> -->
                                 				</div>
                                 				<div class="culturetxtright"> 
                                    				<img loading="lazy" alt="" data-src="https://www.gera.in/assets/images/webp/02-A.webp" alt="Gera Developments" class="lazyload" width="100%" height="100%"> 
                                 				</div>
                              				</div>
                           				</div>
                           				<div>
                              				<div class="culturelistbox">
                                 				<div class="culturetxtleft">
                                    				<div class="cultureleftHeading"> Pune’s First <br> Intelligent Building-Gera Legend</div>
                                    				<p class="culturetxt"> Combining cutting-edge technology and design, we introduced businesses to a novel environment to grow and meet their ambitions in 2001.</p>
                                					<!-- <div class="learnMore expl"> <a href="#">Explore Now  </a> </div> -->
                                 				</div>
                                 				<div class="culturetxtright"> 
                                    				<img loading="lazy" alt="" data-src="https://www.gera.in/assets/images/webp/03-A.webp" alt="Gera Developments" class="lazyload" width="100%" height="100%"> 
                                 				</div>
                              				</div>
